    power, intersection, colon, and other ideal-algebra operations on DG ideals
  * *note DGIdeal + DGIdeal: DGIdeal + DGIdeal, -- Sum of two DG ideals
  * *note DGIdeal ^ ZZ: DGIdeal ^ ZZ, -- Nonnegative integer power of a DG
    ideal

