|i4 : I = dgIdeal(A, {x_Anat})                      |
|                                                   |
|o4 = DGIdeal of Anat                               |
|     generators => | x |                           |
|                                                   |
|o4 : DGIdeal                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : (x_Anat^2 % I) == 0                           |
|                                                   |
|o5 = true                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : (y_Anat^2 % I) == y_Anat^2                    |
|                                                   |
|o6 = true                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------+

