    power, intersection, colon, and other ideal-algebra operations on DG ideals
  * *note DGIdeal: DGIdeal, -- The class of d-closed graded ideals of a DG
    algebra
  * *note dgIdeal: dgIdeal, -- Construct a DG ideal from a list, matrix, or
    ideal of generators

