isHomogeneous(DGIdeal) -- Predicates on a DG ideal
**************************************************

  * Function: *note isHomogeneous: (Macaulay2Doc)isHomogeneous,

Description
===========

isHomogeneous I returns isHomogeneous I.natural — i.e. tests whether the
underlying ideal is homogeneous with respect to the grading of A.natural.

isZero I returns true iff I.natural is the zero ideal (equivalently, numgens
I.natural == 0).

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x, y]                              |
|                                                   |
|o1 = R                                             |
|                                                   |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                        |
|                                                   |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }         |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ..T   ]          |
|                               1,1   1,2           |
|      Differential => {x, y}                       |
|                                                   |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Anat = A.natural                              |
|                                                   |
|o3 = Anat                                          |
|                                                   |
|o3 : PolynomialRing, 2 skew commutative variable(s)|
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : I = dgIdeal(A, {x_Anat, y_Anat})              |
|                                                   |
|o4 = DGIdeal of Anat                               |
|     generators => | y x |                         |
|                                                   |
|o4 : DGIdeal                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isHomogeneous I                               |
|                                                   |
|o5 = true                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isZero I                                      |
|                                                   |
|o6 = false                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Z = dgIdeal(A, {})                            |
|                                                   |
|o7 = DGIdeal of Anat                               |
|     generators => 0                               |
|                                                   |
|o7 : DGIdeal                                       |
