DGQuotientModule -- The class of quotient DG modules M / S
**********************************************************

Description
===========

A DGQuotientModule Q = M / S is the cokernel of the inclusion S.inclusion : S →
M, equipped with the induced differential.  Unlike *note DGSubmodule:
DGSubmodule,, DGQuotientModule is NOT a subtype of *note DGModule: DGModule,:
its .natural is a cokernel module, which does not support the free-module
operations (rank, basis by index) that DG algorithms assume on a generic
DGModule.

Beyond the DGModule-like keys (.dgAlgebra, .natural, .Degrees, .diff), a
DGQuotientModule carries:

Q.ambient — the DGModule M from which Q was built; accessible via *note
ambient: (Macaulay2Doc)ambient,.

Q.subDGModule — the killed submodule S; accessible via *note subDGModule:
ambient,.

Q.projection — the quotient map M → Q as a *note DGModuleMap: DGModuleMap,;
accessible via *note projection: ambient,.

New DGQuotientModules are built by *note dgQuotientModule: dgQuotientModule, or
the shorthand M / S.

+------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x]                  |
|                                    |
|o1 = R                              |
|                                    |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                 |
+------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R         |
|                                    |
|o2 = {Ring => R                    }|
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ] |
|                               1,1  |
|      Differential => {x}           |
|                                    |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                      |
+------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = freeDGModule(A, {0})       |
|                                    |
|o3 = {Base ring => R               }|
|      DG algebra => R[T   ]         |
|                       1,1          |
|                                 1  |
|      Natural module => (R[T   ])   |
|                            1,1     |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}} |
|      Differentials on gens => {0}  |
|                                    |
|o3 : DGModule                       |
+------------------------------------+
|i4 : Z = dgSubmodule(M, {})         |
|                                    |
|o4 = DGSubmodule of ambient DGModule|
|     Degrees  => {}                 |
|     natural  => 0                  |
|     inclusion => 0                 |
|                                    |
|o4 : DGSubmodule                    |
+------------------------------------+
|i5 : Q = M / Z                      |
|                                    |
|o5 = DGQuotientModule Q = M / S     |
|                          1         |
|     Q.natural = (R[T   ])          |
|                     1,1            |
|     Degrees   = {{0, 0}}           |
|                                    |
|o5 : DGQuotientModule               |
+------------------------------------+
|i6 : instance(Q, DGQuotientModule)  |
|                                    |
|o6 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i7 : ambient Q === M                |
|                                    |
|o7 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i8 : subDGModule Q === Z            |
|                                    |
|o8 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i9 : source projection Q === M      |
|                                    |
|o9 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i10 : target projection Q === Q     |
|                                    |
|o10 = true                          |
+------------------------------------+

