    DGQuotientModule hierarchy and its constructors
  * *note Operations on DG Submodules: Operations on DG Submodules, -- Sum,
    intersection, equality, and containment of DG submodules
  * *note DGSubmodule: DGSubmodule, -- The class of d-closed submodules of a DG
    module
