* isFreeDGModule::              Is the underlying A.natural-module free?
* isZero(DGModule): isZero_lpDGModule_rp.  Does the DG object have no natural generators?
* super(DGSubmodule): super_lpDGSubmodule_rp.  Ambient DGModule, cover, and relation matrix of a DG sub- or quotient module
