    modules, -- Basic queries (generators, rank, degrees, homogeneity) extended
    to DG modules and their sub- and quotient modules
  * *note freeDGModule: freeDGModule, -- Construct a free DG module over a DG
    algebra
  * *note isWellDefined(DGModule): isWellDefined_lpDGModule_rp, -- Check that a
    DG module has correct structure and that its differential squares to zero

Ways to use isFreeDGModule:
===========================

  * "isFreeDGModule(DGModule)"
  * "isFreeDGModule(DGSubmodule)"

