    cokernel of DG module maps, -- Building DG submodules and DG quotient
    modules from a DG module map
  * *note image(DGModuleMap): image_lpDGModuleMap_rp, -- Image of a DG module
    map as a DG submodule of its target
  * *note kernel(DGModuleMap): kernel_lpDGModuleMap_rp, -- Kernel of a DG
    module map as a DG submodule of its source
  * *note DGQuotientModule: DGQuotientModule, -- The class of quotient DG
    modules M / S
  * *note DGModule / DGSubmodule: DGModule / DGSubmodule, -- Quotient DG
    module: M / S

