* HH_ZZ DGQuotientModule: HH_usZZ DGQuotientModule.  The degree-n homology of a DG quotient module
* HH DGQuotientModule::         The graded homology of a DG quotient module
* homologyClass(DGModule,Vector): homologyClass_lpDGModule_cmVector_rp.  The homology class of a cycle in a DG module
