    DG module maps, -- Computing H_n and H_* for DG modules, DG submodules, DG
    quotient modules, and DG module maps
  * *note HH DGModule: HH DGModule, -- The graded homology of a DG module as a
    module over HH(A)
  * *note homology(DGModuleMap,ZZ): homology_lpDGModuleMap_cmZZ_rp, -- The
    induced map on degree-n homology of a DG module map
  * *note HH_ZZ DGQuotientModule: HH_usZZ DGQuotientModule, -- The degree-n
    homology of a DG quotient module
