========

  * *note Homology of DG modules and DG module maps: Homology of DG modules and
    DG module maps, -- Computing H_n and H_* for DG modules, DG submodules, DG
    quotient modules, and DG module maps
  * *note HH_ZZ DGModule: HH_usZZ DGModule, -- The degree-n homology of a DG
    module as a module over the base ring
  * *note HH DGAlgebra: HH DGAlgebra, -- The homology algebra of a DG algebra
  * *note homologyModule: homologyModule, -- Compute the homology of a DGModule
    as a module over a DGAlgebra.
  * *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, -- Compute the homology algebra of
    a DGAlgebra.

