prune(DGSubmodule) -- Trim a DG submodule to a minimal generating set of its inclusion
**************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note prune: (Macaulay2Doc)prune,
  * Usage: 
        Sp = prune S
        Sp = minimalPresentation S
  * Inputs:
      * S, an instance of the type *note DGSubmodule: DGSubmodule,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Exclude: (Macaulay2Doc)minimalPresentation_lpRing_rp, => ...,
        default value {},
  * Outputs:
      * Sp, an instance of the type *note DGSubmodule: DGSubmodule,, A DG
        submodule of the same ambient DG module whose inclusion matrix has had
        A.natural-linearly redundant columns removed.

Description
===========

prune S computes mingens image S.inclusion.natural and builds a new DG
submodule from that reduced inclusion matrix.  The A.natural-span of the new
inclusion matrix equals the original: image Sp.inclusion.natural == image
S.inclusion.natural.

A pruningMap is cached in Sp.cache as a *note DGModuleMap: DGModuleMap, from Sp
to S; when the inclusion matrix is already minimal this is the identity on S
(and prune S === S).

Well-definedness (d-closure) and the underlying natural-level image are
preserved by pruning.

+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x, y]                                           |
|                                                                |
|o1 = R                                                          |
|                                                                |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                                     |
|                                                                |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }                      |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ..T   ]                       |
|                               1,1   1,2                        |
|      Differential => {x, y}                                    |
|                                                                |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Anat = A.natural                                           |
|                                                                |
|o3 = Anat                                                       |
|                                                                |
|o3 : PolynomialRing, 2 skew commutative variable(s)             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : M = freeDGModule(A, {0})                                   |
|                                                                |
|o4 = {Base ring => R               }                            |
|      DG algebra => Anat                                        |
|                            1                                   |
|      Natural module => Anat                                    |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}}                             |
|      Differentials on gens => {0}                              |
|                                                                |
|o4 : DGModule                                                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : S = dgSubmodule(M, matrix {{1_Anat, x_Anat, y_Anat}})      |
|                                                                |
|o5 = DGSubmodule of ambient DGModule                            |
|     Degrees  => {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}}                       |
|                     3                                          |
|     natural  => Anat                                           |
|     inclusion => | 1 x y |                                     |
|                                                                |
|o5 : DGSubmodule                                                |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : Sp = prune S                                               |
|                                                                |
|o6 = DGSubmodule of ambient DGModule                            |
|     Degrees  => {{0, 0}}                                       |
|                     1                                          |
|     natural  => Anat                                           |
|     inclusion => | 1 |                                         |
|                                                                |
|o6 : DGSubmodule                                                |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : numcols (inclusion Sp).natural                             |
|                                                                |
|o7 = 1                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : numcols (inclusion S).natural                              |
|                                                                |
|o8 = 3                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : image (inclusion S).natural == image (inclusion Sp).natural|
|                                                                |
|o9 = true                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : isWellDefined Sp                                          |
|                                                                |
|o10 = true                                                      |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+

minimalPresentation is a synonym for prune on DG submodules.

