    modules_cm submodules_cm quotients_cm and maps, -- Minimizing presentations
    of DG types via prune and minimalPresentation
  * *note prune(DGSubmodule): prune_lpDGSubmodule_rp, -- Trim a DG submodule to
    a minimal generating set of its inclusion
  * *note dgQuotientModule: dgQuotientModule, -- Construct the quotient DG
    module M / S
  * *note DGModule / DGSubmodule: DGModule / DGSubmodule, -- Quotient DG
    module: M / S

