    Well-definedness_cm acyclicity_cm and quasi-isomorphism, -- Predicates that
    check DG-theoretic conditions on DG types
  * *note DGSubmodule: DGSubmodule, -- The class of d-closed submodules of a DG
    module
  * *note dgSubmodule: dgSubmodule, -- Construct a d-closed submodule of a DG
    module
  * *note isWellDefined(DGModule): isWellDefined_lpDGModule_rp, -- Check that a
    DG module has correct structure and that its differential squares to zero
  * *note isWellDefined(DGQuotientModule): isWellDefined_lpDGQuotientModule_rp,
    -- Check that a DG quotient module has a well-defined differential

