isWellDefined(DGQuotientModule) -- Check that a DG quotient module has a well-defined differential
**************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isWellDefined: (Macaulay2Doc)isWellDefined,
  * Usage: 
        b = isWellDefined Q
  * Inputs:
      * Q, an instance of the type *note DGQuotientModule: DGQuotientModule,, 
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, True when Q has all
        expected structural keys, its projection map has the right source and
        target, and its relations submodule Q.subDGModule is itself a
        well-defined DG submodule of Q.ambient.

Description
===========

After a structural key-shape check, verifies that Q.ambient is a *note
DGModule: DGModule,, that Q.subDGModule is a *note DGSubmodule: DGSubmodule,
with ambient equal to Q.ambient, and that Q.projection is a *note DGModuleMap:
DGModuleMap, from Q.ambient to Q. The substantive check then delegates to *note
isWellDefined(DGSubmodule): isWellDefined_lpDGSubmodule_rp, on the relations
submodule: the quotient is well-defined exactly when the relations are d-closed
in the ambient.

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x]                                      |
|                                                        |
|o1 = R                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                             |
|                                                        |
|o2 = {Ring => R                    }                    |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ]                     |
|                               1,1                      |
|      Differential => {x}                               |
|                                                        |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = freeDGModule(A, {0, 1})                        |
|                                                        |
|o3 = {Base ring => R                       }            |
|      DG algebra => R[T   ]                             |
|                       1,1                              |
|                                 2                      |
|      Natural module => (R[T   ])                       |
|                            1,1                         |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}, {1, 0}}             |
|      Differentials on gens => {0, 0}                   |
|                                                        |
|o3 : DGModule                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : natGens = apply(rank M.natural, i -> (M.natural)_i)|
|                                                        |
|o4 = {| 1 |, | 0 |}                                     |
|      | 0 |  | 1 |                                      |
|                                                        |
|o4 : List                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : setDiff(M, {0, x * natGens#0})                     |
|                                                        |
|o5 = {Base ring => R                       }            |
|      DG algebra => R[T   ]                             |
|                       1,1                              |
|                                 2                      |
|      Natural module => (R[T   ])                       |
|                            1,1                         |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}, {1, 0}}             |
|      Differentials on gens => {0, | x |}               |
|                                   | 0 |                |
|                                                        |
|o5 : DGModule                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : S = dgSubmodule(M, (id_(M.natural))_{1})           |
|                                                        |
|o6 = DGSubmodule of ambient DGModule                    |
|     Degrees  => {{1, 0}, {0, 0}}                       |
|                          2                             |
|     natural  => (R[T   ])                              |
|                     1,1                                |
|     inclusion => {0, 0} | 0 x |                        |
|                  {1, 0} | 1 0 |                        |
|                                                        |
|o6 : DGSubmodule                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Q = M / S                                          |
|                                                        |
|o7 = DGQuotientModule Q = M / S                         |
|     Q.natural = cokernel {0, 0} | 0 x |                |
|                          {1, 0} | 1 0 |                |
|     Degrees   = {{0, 0}, {1, 0}}                       |
|                                                        |
|o7 : DGQuotientModule                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : isWellDefined Q                                    |
|                                                        |
|o8 = true                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+

