    Well-definedness_cm acyclicity_cm and quasi-isomorphism, -- Predicates that
    check DG-theoretic conditions on DG types
  * *note isAcyclic(DGModule): isAcyclic_lpDGModule_rp, -- Determine whether a
    DG module has vanishing positive-degree homology
  * *note HH_ZZ DGQuotientModule: HH_usZZ DGQuotientModule, -- The degree-n
    homology of a DG quotient module
