    Well-definedness_cm acyclicity_cm and quasi-isomorphism, -- Predicates that
    check DG-theoretic conditions on DG types
  * *note annihilator(DGQuotientModule): annihilator_lpDGQuotientModule_rp, --
    The DG ideal of A annihilating a DG quotient module
  * *note DGIdeal: DGIdeal, -- The class of d-closed graded ideals of a DG
    algebra
