Description
===========

Controls the first hom-degree at which *note semifreeResolution:
semifreeResolution, attempts to kill homology. Hom-degrees strictly below
StartDegree are populated only by the initial free cover and the adjoinment of
presentation relations at hom-degree 1.  The default value is 1.

