The 2x2 blocks alternate between an x-pattern and an x^4-pattern; their product
is x^5 times an identity matrix, which is exactly the matrix factorization x *
x^4 = x^5.  Similarly, for the quadric form f = x^2 + y^2 the module coker [[x,
