    whether a semifree DG module is minimal over its DG algebra
  * *note getBoundaryPreimage: getBoundaryPreimage, -- Attempt to find a
    preimage of a boundary under the differential of a DGAlgebra.
  * *note killCycles(DGModule): killCycles_lpDGModule_rp, -- Adjoin free
