  * *note HH_ZZ DGModule: HH_usZZ DGModule, -- The degree-n homology of a DG
    module as a module over the base ring
* Menu:

* moduleDifferential::          The hom-degree-n differential of a DG module as a matrix over the base ring
* diff(DGModule,Vector): diff_lpDGModule_cmVector_rp.  Apply the DG module differential to an element
