    module differentials and visualizing DG modules, -- Differential matrices,
    element-wise differentials, and visualization helpers for DG modules
  * *note moduleDifferential: moduleDifferential, -- The hom-degree-n
    differential of a DG module as a matrix over the base ring
  * *note diff(DGQuotientModule,Vector): diff_lpDGQuotientModule_cmVector_rp,
    -- Apply the induced differential on a DG quotient module to an element
  * *note diff(DGAlgebra,RingElement): diff_lpDGAlgebra_cmRingElement_rp, --
    Apply the differential of a DGAlgebra to a ring element

