    from existing DG algebras, -- Base change, generator restriction,
    truncation, and targeted cycle-killing for DG algebras
  * *note restrictDifferential: restrictDifferential, -- Synonym for
    subDGAlgebra, named to match the restricted-differential vocabulary
  * *note truncateGenerators: truncateGenerators, -- Restrict a DG algebra to
    its generators of hom-degree strictly above a bound

