isWellDefinedDifferential -- Semantic check that d^2 = 0 for a DG algebra or DG module
**************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        b = isWellDefinedDifferential A
        b = isWellDefinedDifferential M
  * Inputs:
      * A, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,, A DG algebra.
      * M, an instance of the type *note DGModule: DGModule,, A DG module.
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true when the
        composition d_{n-1} * d_n is zero for every relevant n.

