generatorDegrees -- The hom-degrees (and optional internal degrees) of the DG generators
****************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        degs = generatorDegrees A
        degs = generatorDegrees M
  * Inputs:
      * A, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,, 
      * M, an instance of the type *note DGModule: DGModule,, 
