|      Natural module => (R[T   ..T   ])             |
|                            1,1   1,2               |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {3, 0}} |
|      Differentials on gens => {0, 0, 0}            |
|                                                    |
|o4 : DGModule                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------+
