setDiff(DGModule,List) -- Install the list of generator differentials on a free DG module
*****************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note setDiff: setDiff,
  * Usage: 
        setDiff(M, diffList)
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note DGModule: DGModule,, A free DG module
        (from *note freeDGModule: freeDGModule,).
      * diffList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, One entry per natural
        generator of M.  Each entry is a vector of M.natural (or 0, or a
        one-column matrix that will be folded into a vector).
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note InitializeComplex: setDiff, => ..., default value true, Install
        or replace the differential on a DG algebra
      * *note InitializeDegreeZeroHomology: setDiff, => ..., default value
        true, Install or replace the differential on a DG algebra
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note DGModule: DGModule,, The same M, mutated
        to carry the new differentials.

Description
===========

setDiff is the DG module analogue of *note setDiff(DGAlgebra,List): setDiff,:
it records the image of the i-th natural generator under the differential in
the i-th slot of M.diff, and clears every cached derived value so that later
calls to *note moduleDifferential: moduleDifferential, or *note homology:
(Macaulay2Doc)homology, will recompute from the newly installed data.  Only
free DG modules (those produced by *note freeDGModule: freeDGModule,) are
accepted; the list length must match the number of natural generators.

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x]                                          |
|                                                        |
|o1 = R                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                             |
|                                                        |
|o2 = {Ring => R                    }                    |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ]                     |
|                               1,1                      |
|      Differential => {x}                               |
|                                                        |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = freeDGModule(A, {0, 1})                        |
|                                                        |
|o3 = {Base ring => R                       }            |
|      DG algebra => R[T   ]                             |
|                       1,1                              |
|                                 2                      |
|      Natural module => (R[T   ])                       |
|                            1,1                         |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}, {1, 0}}             |
|      Differentials on gens => {0, 0}                   |
|                                                        |
|o3 : DGModule                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : natGens = apply(rank M.natural, i -> (M.natural)_i)|
|                                                        |
|o4 = {| 1 |, | 0 |}                                     |
|      | 0 |  | 1 |                                      |
|                                                        |
|o4 : List                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : setDiff(M, {0, x^2 * natGens#0})                   |
|                                                        |
|o5 = {Base ring => R                       }            |
|      DG algebra => R[T   ]                             |
|                       1,1                              |
|                                 2                      |
|      Natural module => (R[T   ])                       |
|                            1,1                         |
|      Generator degrees => {{0, 0}, {1, 0}}             |
|      Differentials on gens => {0, | x2 |}              |
|                                   |  0 |               |
|                                                        |
|o5 : DGModule                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : d1 = moduleDifferential(1, M)                      |
|                                                        |
|o6 = | x x2 |                                           |
|                                                        |
|             1      2                                   |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : d2 = moduleDifferential(2, M)                      |
|                                                        |
|o7 = {1} | -x2 |                                        |
|     {0} | x   |                                        |
|                                                        |
|             2      1                                   |
|o7 : Matrix R  <-- R                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : assert(d1 * d2 == 0)                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note DG module primitives and chain-complex export: DG module primitives
    and chain-complex export, -- Installing differentials, reading degree data,
    and exporting to Complex
  * *note freeDGModule: freeDGModule, -- Construct a free DG module over a DG
    algebra
  * *note setDiff(DGAlgebra,List): setDiff, -- Install or replace the
    differential on a DG algebra
  * *note moduleDifferential: moduleDifferential, -- The hom-degree-n
    differential of a DG module as a matrix over the base ring
