    and chain-complex export, -- Installing differentials, reading degree data,
    and exporting to Complex
  * *note maxDegree: maxDegree, -- Computes the maximum homological degree of a
    DGAlgebra
  * *note maxDegree(DGQuotientModule): maxDegree_lpDGQuotientModule_rp, --
    Largest hom-degree present in a DG quotient module
  * *note maxDegree(DGAlgebra): maxDegree, -- Computes the maximum homological
    degree of a DGAlgebra

