    and chain-complex export, -- Installing differentials, reading degree data,
    and exporting to Complex
  * *note getBasis: getBasis, -- Get a basis for a particular homological
    degree of a DG algebra.
  * *note getBasis(ZZ,DGAlgebra): getBasis, -- Get a basis for a particular
    homological degree of a DG algebra.
