    and chain-complex export, -- Installing differentials, reading degree data,
    and exporting to Complex
  * *note toComplexMap: toComplexMap, -- Construct the ComplexMap associated to
    a DGAlgebraMap
  * *note toComplexMap(DGModuleMap,ZZ): toComplexMap_lpDGModuleMap_cmZZ_rp, --
    The per-hom-degree component of a DG module map as a matrix
