deviationsToPoincare -- Computes the power series corresponding to a set of deviations.
***************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        pSeries = deviationsToPoincare(devHash)
  * Inputs:
      * devHash, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, HashTable of the
        same form as the output from *note deviations: deviations,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * DegreeLimit => ..., default value 0
