Description
===========

This command takes a HashTable of the same form output from *note deviations:
deviations, and produces the Poincare series corresponding to it. The
(key,value) pairs must be of the form homologicalDegree=>number or
(homologicalDegree,internalDegree)=>number. Because

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a,b,c]/ideal{a^3,b^3,c^3}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : RDevs = deviations(R,DegreeLimit=>6)                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = HashTable{(1, {1}) => 3}                                                |
|               (2, {3}) => 3                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : HashTable                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : devPSeries = deviationsToPoincare(RDevs,DegreeLimit=>6)                 |
|                                                                             |
|        6 9      6 8      5 7     5 6     4 6     4 5     3 4    3 3     2 3 |
|o3 = 10S T  + 18S T  + 18S T  + 3S T  + 6S T  + 9S T  + 9S T  + S T  + 3S T  |
|          0        0        0       0       0       0       0      0       0 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         2 2                                                                 |
|     + 3S T  + 3S*T  + 1                                                     |
|           0       0                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|     ZZ[S, T ]                                                               |
|            0                                                                |
|o3 : ---------                                                               |
|          7                                                                  |
|         S                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : pSeries = poincareN (freeResolution(coker vars R, LengthLimit=>6))      |
|                                                                             |
|                   2 2     2 3    3 3     3 4     4 5     4 6     5 6        |
|o4 = 1 + 3S*T  + 3S T  + 3S T  + S T  + 9S T  + 9S T  + 6S T  + 3S T  +      |
|             0       0       0      0       0       0       0       0        |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|        5 7      6 8      6 9                                                |
|     18S T  + 18S T  + 10S T                                                 |
|          0        0        0                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ZZ[S, T ]                                                               |
|            0                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : substitute(devPSeries,ring pSeries) == pSeries                          |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

