    findTrivialMasseyOperation_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmGenDegreeLimit=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, --
    Maximum homological degree of generators used in the trivial Massey
    operation search
  * *note homologyAlgebra(...,GenDegreeLimit=>...):
    homologyAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmGenDegreeLimit=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- Maximum
    homological degree searched for homology-algebra generators
