    getBoundaryPreimage_lpDGModule_cmList_rp, -- Lift a list of boundaries
    sharing a hom-degree through the module differential
  * *note getBoundaryPreimage(DGModule,Vector):
    getBoundaryPreimage_lpDGModule_cmVector_rp, -- Lift a boundary in a DG
    module to a preimage under the differential

