getGenerators -- Cycles whose classes generate the homology algebra of a DG algebra
***********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        cycleList = getGenerators A
  * Inputs:
      * A, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note DegreeLimit: getGenerators_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDegreeLimit=>_pd_pd_pd_
        rp, => ..., default value -1, Last homological degree in which to
        search for algebra generators
      * *note StartDegree: getGenerators_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStartDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_
        rp, => ..., default value 1, First homological degree in which to
        search for new algebra generators
      * *note Verbosity: getGenerators_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVerbosity=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
        => ..., default value 0, Option to control progress output from
        getGenerators
  * Outputs:
      * cycleList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of cycles in
        A.natural whose homology classes generate HH_*(A) as a
        graded-commutative algebra over A.ring

Description
===========

Walks up the homological degrees of A, computing a basis of each homology
module and selecting minimal new generators not already reachable by products
of lower-degree cycles.  The returned list is exactly the generating set used
internally by *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, to build its
presentation.

This version of the function assumes all algebra generators of A lie in odd
homological degree.  When A has generators in even degree, a finite generating
set need not exist, and the search depth must be bounded with EndDegree or
*note GenDegreeLimit: GenDegreeLimit,.

+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a,b,c] / ideal(a^3, b^3, c^3, a^2*b^2*c^2)|
|                                                          |
|o1 = R                                                    |
|                                                          |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                         |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                               |
|                                                          |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }                |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ..T   ]                 |
|                               1,1   1,3                  |
|      Differential => {a, b, c}                           |
|                                                          |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : netList getGenerators A                              |
|                                                          |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2                |                                 |
|o3 = |a T               |                                 |
|     |   1,1            |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2                |                                 |
|     |b T               |                                 |
|     |   1,2            |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2                |                                 |
|     |c T               |                                 |
|     |   1,3            |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     |   2 2            |                                 |
|     |a*b c T           |                                 |
|     |       1,1        |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     |   2 2            |                                 |
|     |a*b c T   T       |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,2    |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2   2            |                                 |
|     |a b*c T   T       |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,2    |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     |   2 2            |                                 |
|     |a*b c T   T       |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,3    |                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     |   2 2            |                                 |
|     |a*b c T   T   T   |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,2 1,3|                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2   2            |                                 |
|     |a b*c T   T   T   |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,2 1,3|                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
|     | 2 2              |                                 |
|     |a b c*T   T   T   |                                 |
|     |       1,1 1,2 1,3|                                 |
|     +------------------+                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------+

The generators above are the cycles used to present homologyAlgebra A; their
classes span HH_i A in each positive degree.

+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : apply(maxDegree A + 1, i -> numgens prune homology(i, A))|
|                                                              |
|o4 = {1, 4, 6, 3}                                             |
|                                                              |
|o4 : List                                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra, -- The class of all DGAlgebras
  * *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, -- Compute the homology algebra of
    a DGAlgebra.
  * *note HH_ZZ DGAlgebra: HH_usZZ DGAlgebra, -- Computes the homology of a DG
    algebra as a module
  * *note homologyClass: homologyClass, -- Computes the element of the homology
    algebra corresponding to a cycle in a DGAlgebra.

