HH DGAlgebraMap -- The induced ring map on homology algebras
************************************************************

  * Function: *note homology: (Macaulay2Doc)homology,
  * Usage: 
        homologyPhi = homology phi
        homologyPhi = HH phi
  * Inputs:
      * phi, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebraMap: DGAlgebraMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * homologyPhi, a *note ring map: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap,, the induced map
        HH(source phi) -> HH(target phi)

Description
===========

A *note DGAlgebraMap: DGAlgebraMap, phi: A -> B is a chain map, so it descends
to a ring map on homology algebras.  This function computes that induced map,
returning a *note RingMap: (Macaulay2Doc)RingMap, from *note homologyAlgebra:
homologyAlgebra, of the source to *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, of
the target.  The homology algebras are computed via *note homologyAlgebra:
homologyAlgebra, if they have not been cached.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a,b,c]/ideal{a^3 + b^3 + c^3, a*b*c}                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : K1 = koszulComplexDGA(ideal vars R, Variable => "Y")                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }                                   |
|      Underlying algebra => R[Y   ..Y   ]                                    |
|                               1,1   1,3                                     |
|      Differential => {a, b, c}                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K2 = koszulComplexDGA(ideal{b, c}, Variable => "T")                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {Ring => R                          }                                   |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ..T   ]                                    |
|                               1,1   1,2                                     |
|      Differential => {b, c}                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : DGAlgebra                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : g = dgAlgebraMap(K1, K2, matrix{{Y_(1,2), Y_(1,3)}})                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = map (R[Y   ..Y   ], R[T   ..T   ], {Y   , Y   , a, b, c})               |
|             1,1   1,3      1,1   1,2     1,2   1,3                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : DGAlgebraMap                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : HHg = HH g                                                              |
|Finding easy relations           :  -- used 0.108898s (cpu); 0.0519328s      |
|                                                                             |
|                         ZZ                                                  |
|                        ---[a..c]                                            |
|           ZZ           101                                                  |
|o5 = map (---[X ..X ], ----------[X ], {X , 0, 0, 0})                        |
|          101  1   2           3   1     1                                   |
|                       (c, b, a )                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                               ZZ                                            |
|                              ---[a..c]                                      |
|              ZZ              101                                            |
|o5 : RingMap ---[X ..X ] <-- ----------[X ]                                  |
|             101  1   2              3   1                                   |
|                             (c, b, a )                                      |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|(thread); 0s (gc)                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : source HHg === homologyAlgebra K1                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : target HHg === homologyAlgebra K2                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note DGAlgebraMap: DGAlgebraMap, -- The class of DG algebra maps
  * *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, -- Compute the homology algebra of
    a DGAlgebra.
  * *note toComplexMap: toComplexMap, -- Construct the ComplexMap associated to
    a DGAlgebraMap

