HH_ZZ DGAlgebra -- Computes the homology of a DG algebra as a module
********************************************************************

  * Function: *note homology: (Macaulay2Doc)homology,
  * Usage: 
        H = homology(n,A)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
