Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/32003[x,y,z]                                 |
|                                                         |
|o1 = R                                                   |
|                                                         |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA(R)                             |
|                                                         |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }               |
