homologyClass -- Computes the element of the homology algebra corresponding to a cycle in a DGAlgebra.
******************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        h = homologyClass(A,z)
  * Inputs:
      * A, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,, 
      * z, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 

