This function computes the element in the homology algebra of a cycle in a
*note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,. In order to do this, the *note homologyAlgebra:
homologyAlgebra, is retrieved (or computed, if it hasn't been already).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[x,y,z]                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
