identityDGAlgebraMap -- The identity DGAlgebraMap on a DG algebra
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        idA = identityDGAlgebraMap A
  * Inputs:
      * A, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra,, 
  * Outputs:
      * idA, an instance of the type *note DGAlgebraMap: DGAlgebraMap,, 

Description
===========

Returns the identity self-map of A as a DGAlgebraMap.  Under the hood the
underlying RingMap A.natural -> A.natural is the identity map on every
generator (including the base-ring generators).

+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]/ideal(x^2,y^2)                            |
|                                                           |
|o1 = R                                                     |
|                                                           |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = koszulComplexDGA R                                |
|                                                           |
|o2 = {Ring => R                          }                 |
|      Underlying algebra => R[T   ..T   ]                  |
|                               1,1   1,2                   |
|      Differential => {x, y}                               |
|                                                           |
|o2 : DGAlgebra                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : idA = identityDGAlgebraMap A                          |
|                                                           |
|o3 = map (R[T   ..T   ], R[T   ..T   ], {T   , T   , x, y})|
|             1,1   1,2      1,1   1,2     1,1   1,2        |
|                                                           |
|o3 : DGAlgebraMap                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (idA * idA) == idA                                    |
|                                                           |
|o4 = true                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+

