|                 {2, 2} | 0 0 1 |                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : DGModuleMap                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|2)                                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isWellDefined quism                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

