    closure of the residue field, starting from the Koszul complex
  * *note koszulComplexDGA: koszulComplexDGA, -- The Koszul complex on the
    variables of a ring, as a DG algebra
  * *note koszulComplexDGA(Ideal): koszulComplexDGA_lpIdeal_rp, -- The Koszul
    complex on the generators of an ideal, as a DG algebra

