RelDegreeLimit -- Option to bound the homological degree searched for algebra relations
***************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        homologyAlgebra(..., RelDegreeLimit => n)
        torAlgebra(..., RelDegreeLimit => n)

Description
===========

Once generators have been chosen (see *note GenDegreeLimit: GenDegreeLimit,), a
homology algebra computation must determine relations among them.
RelDegreeLimit bounds the homological degree up to which those relations are
searched.  Typical practice is to set RelDegreeLimit to roughly twice
GenDegreeLimit, since relations can be degree-sums of generator pairs.

See also
========

  * *note GenDegreeLimit: GenDegreeLimit, -- Option to bound the homological
    degree searched for algebra generators
  * *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, -- Compute the homology algebra of
    a DGAlgebra.
  * *note torAlgebra: torAlgebra, -- Computes the Tor algebra of a ring

