  * *note homologyAlgebra(...,RelDegreeLimit=>...):
    homologyAlgebra_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmRelDegreeLimit=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- Maximum
    homological degree searched for homology-algebra relations
  * *note torAlgebra(...,RelDegreeLimit=>...):
