Returns the *note DGAlgebra: DGAlgebra, from which phi is defined.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a,b,c]/ideal{a^3, b^3, c^3}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = R / ideal{a^2*b^2*c^2}                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = acyclicClosure(R, EndDegree => 2)                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {Ring => R                                        }                     |
