StartDegree -- Option to specify the first homological degree processed by an iterative DG construction
*******************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        acyclicClosure(..., StartDegree => n)
        killCycles(..., StartDegree => n)
        getGenerators(..., StartDegree => n)

Description
===========

Several routines in this package build DG algebras one homological degree at a
time, starting from degree StartDegree and incrementing up to an appropriate
endpoint.  Raising StartDegree can be useful when a partial acyclic closure has
already been cached and you wish to continue the construction from where it
left off.  The default value is 1.

See also
========

  * *note EndDegree: EndDegree, -- Option to specify the last homological
    degree processed by an iterative DG construction
  * *note acyclicClosure: acyclicClosure, -- Tate's construction of a semifree
    acyclic DG algebra extension
  * *note killCycles: killCycles, -- Adjoin variables to kill non-bounding
    cycles in the lowest positive degree
  * *note getGenerators: getGenerators, -- Cycles whose classes generate the
    homology algebra of a DG algebra

Functions with optional argument named StartDegree:
===================================================

  * *note acyclicClosure(...,StartDegree=>...):
    acyclicClosure_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStartDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- Option to
    specify the degree to start computing the acyclic closure.
  * *note getGenerators(...,StartDegree=>...):
    getGenerators_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStartDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- First homological
    degree in which to search for new algebra generators
  * *note killCycles(...,StartDegree=>...):
    killCycles_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStartDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- First homological
    degree from which killCycles begins searching for cycles
  * "minimalModel(...,StartDegree=>...)" -- see *note minimalModel:
    minimalModel, -- Build the minimal DG algebra resolution of a quotient ring
  * *note minimalSemifreeResolution(...,StartDegree=>...):
    minimalSemifreeResolution_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStartDegree=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, --
