Verbosity -- Option controlling the verbosity level of DGAlgebras computations
******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        homologyAlgebra(..., Verbosity => n)
        getGenerators(..., Verbosity => n)

Description
===========

Several iterative routines in this package accept a Verbosity option whose
value is a nonnegative integer.  Higher values print more diagnostic output
about the steps being performed (cycle searches, relation searches,
degree-by-degree progress, etc.).  The default value is 0, which suppresses all
progress output.

See also
========

  * *note homologyAlgebra: homologyAlgebra, -- Compute the homology algebra of
    a DGAlgebra.
  * *note getGenerators: getGenerators, -- Cycles whose classes generate the
    homology algebra of a DG algebra

